OL,3,GNEWSAFestival granted music extension
OL,4,Adespite noise concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading Festival has been given
OL,7,Fpermission for music on its main stage
OL,8,Ffor a fourth day despite residents'
OL,9,Fobjections.
OL,11,FMore than 100,000 people typically
OL,12,Fattend the August bank holiday weekend
OL,13,Fevent and event organisers Festival
OL,14,FRepublic will be able to use the main
OL,15,Fstage on Thursdays between 17:00 and
OL,16,F23:00 BST from 2027.
OL,18,FAssociations representing hundreds of
OL,19,Fresidents opposed the change over
OL,20,Fpotential disruption and increased
OL,21,Fnoise affecting those living nearby.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
