OL,3,GNEWSAFestival granted music extension
OL,4,Adespite noise concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FManaging director Mevin Benn told
OL,7,FReading Borough Council's licensing
OL,8,Fcommittee that it wanted to "give
OL,9,Fpeople better value for money".
